<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN FAIRS Q1 NET PROFIT 5.1 MLN EEK.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN FAIRS Q1 NET PROFIT 5.1 MLN EEK.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian Fairs had a net profit of 5.1 million kroons and turnover of 14.5 million kroons during the first quarter, the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company had a net profit of 6.48 million kroons in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
